{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":48,"count":34,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-06\",\"栋\",\"棟\",\"栋\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這棟房子不大，可是很貴。","pinyin":"Zhè dòng fángzi bú dà, kěshì hěn guì.","english":"This is not a big house, but very expensive.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-05","sourceFront":"房子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-2-10\",\"別人\",\"別人\",\"别人\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這裡只有我，沒有別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-10","sourceFront":"別人","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"如果我們對別人好，別人也會對我們好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-05","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幫助別人讓我覺得很快樂！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-08","sourceFront":"幫助","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"別指著別人的鼻子說話，這樣很不客氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-11","sourceFront":"指","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你老是批評別人，誰想跟你做朋友呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-22","sourceFront":"批評","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果只注意別人的缺點，就永遠看不到他們的優點了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-30","sourceFront":"缺點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有自己的優點，不需要強調，也不必跟別人比來比去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-29","sourceFront":"強調","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小高總是在別人面前表現得很有禮貌，不過回到家就完全變了一個樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-11","sourceFront":"面前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"背包客為了解省交通費，經常搭別人的車到下一個地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-01","sourceFront":"背包客","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小在追求夢想的路上，別太在意別人說什麼，只要不斷地努力，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-31","sourceFront":"在意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我妹妹的個性太單純了，別人說什麼她都相信，難怪常吃虧","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-13","sourceFront":"單純","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大雄從小個性就很被動，別人要求的事他才做，父母跟老師都希望他可以主動一點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-15","sourceFront":"被動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小馬做事又負責又認真，答應別人的事情也一定會做到，是個很可靠的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-26","sourceFront":"可靠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"石先生對自己的想法很堅持，從不接受別人的意見，所以很難相處。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-07","sourceFront":"堅持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在你的國家，第一次辦理護照得本人親自去，不能請別人代替嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-04","sourceFront":"本","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"商先生從不發脾氣，人也很謙虛，不論別人怎麼批評他，他還是很客氣地說謝謝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-26","sourceFront":"不論","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在國外工作的那幾年，他學會了什麼問題都自己解決，不依靠別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-23","sourceFront":"依靠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人的生命價值都是一樣的，不應該為了自己的利益而犧牲別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-26","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這是我和你之間的祕密，你絕對不可告訴別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-12","sourceFront":"祕密","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"收到別人的信時，應該回信告訴對方收到了，這是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-23","sourceFront":"回信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你最好別穿著拖鞋去參加正式活動，要不然別人可能認為你不懂禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-29","sourceFront":"拖鞋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想讓別人看得起你，你得先看得起自己。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-32","sourceFront":"看得起","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個人做錯事多半是自己造成的，不能一做錯就怪別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-34","sourceFront":"多半","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟別人握手時，握得太久或太緊都是沒有禮貌的行為。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-12","sourceFront":"握手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"答應別人的事就要做到，這才是有信用的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-19","sourceFront":"信用","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學習是別人無法代你去做的，得親自來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-20","sourceFront":"代","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想加入社會服務組織，幫助別人的同時也讓自己成長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-06","sourceFront":"組織","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"室友A:嘿，吃完飯後不能把碗筷擺在桌子讓別人洗喔。室友B:不好意思，我這就去洗。室友A:嘿，你還真聽話(obedient)啊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-36","sourceFront":"嘿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"別人對你有誤會的時候用不著生氣，解釋清楚就好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-48","sourceFront":"用不著","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到別人家做客時不能太隨便，以免發生不愉快的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-07","sourceFront":"做客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他沖咖啡的技術很好，香味總是比別人沖的濃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-14","sourceFront":"沖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"完全按照別人的話來工作，是很省事沒錯，卻失去了讓自己進步的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-42","sourceFront":"省事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當別人表現得很好時，別忘了為他們鼓掌，給他們鼓勵。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-12","sourceFront":"鼓掌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要是你對文藝領域不了解，最好不要隨便批評別人的作品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-01","sourceFront":"文藝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"知道自己誤會別人以後，最好早一點兒跟對方道歉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-14","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們無法控制別人的行為，卻能夠改變自己的想法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-21","sourceFront":"控制","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你不需要事事都跟別人做比較，自己過得輕鬆愉快就好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-23","sourceFront":"比較","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"除非別人願意，否則你不該強迫其他人全按你的意見做事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-45","sourceFront":"強迫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她愛好化妝、穿名牌服裝，目的是希望別人讚美她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-12","sourceFront":"讚美","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當別人遇到不愉快的事時，應該避免說些刺激他的話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-36","sourceFront":"刺激","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"連經理很講話，開會時老是說個不停，別人都沒說話的分。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-05","sourceFront":"分","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"看見別人事業很成功，除了羨慕以外，更要學習他的優點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-13","sourceFront":"羨慕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開車時不闖紅燈，是為了自己和別人的生命安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-24","sourceFront":"闖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"動不動就發脾氣的人，往往無法接受別人的寶貴建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-33","sourceFront":"動不動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有不小心發生錯誤的時候，不需要取笑別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-22","sourceFront":"取笑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果不與別人競爭，你就無法進步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-33","sourceFront":"競爭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從事新工作時往往經驗不足，因此向別人請教是必需的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-07","sourceFront":"不足","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他勸我別太在意別人的眼光，把自己負責的事完成就好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-10","sourceFront":"勸","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她的物品上都有個小小的蝴蝶標誌，避免別人拿錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-13","sourceFront":"標誌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"別(other) + 人(person) → other people: 別人(others)."},{"key":"[\"B1L15-1-03\",\"刚才\",\"剛才\",\"刚才\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們下個星期要學第十五課，我剛才先看了一點兒，書上有很多種動物，我覺得很有意思。","pinyin":"Wǒmen xià ge xīngqí yào xué dì shíwǔ kè, wǒ gāngcái xiān kàn le yìdiǎnr, shū shàng yǒu hěn duō zhǒng dòngwù, wǒ juéde hěn yǒuyìsi.","english":"We are going to learn lesson fifteen next week. I previewed a bit earlier just now. There are many kinds of animals in the book; I think it is very interesting.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-2-04\",\"讲话\",\"講話\",\"讲话\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他在跟家人談事情，已經講了三十分鐘的話了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-04","sourceFront":"講話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"連經理很講話，開會時老是說個不停，別人都沒說話的分。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-05","sourceFront":"分","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"坐火車時，一旁的旅客不停地講電話，吵得我受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-43","sourceFront":"一旁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-18\",\"害怕\",\"害怕\",\"害怕\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"天黑了，那個小孩子很害怕，不敢一個人去上廁所。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-18","sourceFront":"害怕","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"天黑了，那個小孩子很害怕，不敢一個人去上廁所。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-19","sourceFront":"敢","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我覺得「害怕」跟「可怕」的意思差不多，所以常弄錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-19","sourceFront":"弄錯","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個孩子可真勇敢！連看到蛇也不害怕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-01","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-2-14\",\"像\",\"像\",\"像\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的眼睛像爸爸，嘴巴像媽媽。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-14","sourceFront":"像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他今天怎麼了？好像不太高興。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-25","sourceFront":"好像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請你想像一下，二十年以後，你的生活會怎麼樣？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-15","sourceFront":"想像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他在 KTV 唱歌的樣子，好像歌星一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-22","sourceFront":"樣子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像珍珠奶茶那樣的飲料，在日本也很受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-14","sourceFront":"那樣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我妹妹非常喜愛像Hello Kitty那樣的卡通人物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-24",