9","sourceFront":"腳步","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她是一個很實際的人，對愛情從來不抱著美好的想像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-22","sourceFront":"抱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A person 亻(person) standing beside an elephant 象(elephant) is a striking picture 像(picture)."},{"key":"[\"B2L05-2-22\",\"真是\",\"真是\",\"真是\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個房子又大又舒服，房租只要三千塊，真是太便宜了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-22","sourceFront":"真是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他參加百貨公司的活動，抽到一台價格六萬元的平板電腦， 真是太幸運了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-11","sourceFront":"抽","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的水災不僅淹了整條街，好幾家工廠也因為淹水沒辦法生產，真是太糟了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-29","sourceFront":"水災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小周才三十歲，就去過四十幾個國家，甚至去過一些又危險又刺激的地方，真是太酷了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-29","sourceFront":"酷","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小李第一次參加釣魚比賽就得了第一名，真是幸運。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-01","sourceFront":"得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天的歐洲足球賽，法國對義大利的比賽真是太刺激了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-11","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小章已經結婚了，還常常跟其他女生約會，真是太花心了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-26","sourceFront":"花心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽生病時，小華給家人做飯、照顧弟弟妹妹，真是個懂事的孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-30","sourceFront":"懂事","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個店員的工作態度很隨便，常弄錯商品的價格，還找錯錢， 真是太誇張了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-08","sourceFront":"隨便","sourceBookId":3,