"chinese":"這場籃球比賽我們贏了對方二十分，真是太痛快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-14","sourceFront":"痛快","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你正好說出了我的心裡話，真是我的知心好友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-19","sourceFront":"正好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:幸虧有你的建議，投資計畫才有很好的結果，真是多謝你了？ B:哪裡哪裡，都是你自己努力得到的成果，要謝就謝你自己吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-20","sourceFront":"謝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"黃媽媽感冒那幾天，她女兒每天煮粥給她吃，真是懂事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-52","sourceFront":"粥","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我同事下個月總算要和交往十年的女朋友結婚了，真是不容易啊！。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-13","sourceFront":"交往","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次會議的效率真差，有人竟然沒看資料就來了，真是誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-15","sourceFront":"竟然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-41\",\"吸引力\",\"吸引力\",\"吸引力\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"超商常舉辦送小禮物或買一送一的活動，可是對王先生完全沒有吸引力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-10","sourceFront":"完全","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-26\",\"年纪\",\"年紀\",\"年纪\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我大哥今年三十歲了，我們的年紀差了十歲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-26","sourceFront":"年紀","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個老人年紀太大，沒辦法一個人生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-29","sourceFront":"老人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個小孩年紀太小，不會自己穿衣服、脫褲子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-20","sourceFront":"脫","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"像踢足球那樣的運動，對年紀大的人不太合適。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-04","sourceFront":"合適","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他雖然年紀小，但是對人有禮貌，也很體貼父母，是個乖孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-08","sourceFront":"乖","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位老太太年紀大了，沒辦法照顧他的狗，所以想幫狗找個新主人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-28","sourceFront":"主人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我爺爺年紀大了，不但體力不好，還有頭痛、肩膀痛的毛病","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-08","sourceFront":"毛病","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小高希望能早日退休，回鄉下照顧年紀大的父母。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-16","sourceFront":"早日","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"弟弟：爺爺怎麼常把我和你的名字搞錯？ 哥哥：爺爺年紀太大了，腦子不清楚，好像不認得我們了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-29","sourceFront":"認得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:哎，有沒有看見我的錢包？ B:哎，你怎麼又在找東西了呢？ A:哎，年紀大了就是這樣？ B:哎，你還年輕呢！讓我幫你一起找吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-05","sourceFront":"哎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在公車上，看到年紀大的人應該讓位子請他們坐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-16","sourceFront":"讓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-2-20\",\"脱\",\"脫\",\"脱\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個小孩年紀太小，不會自己穿衣服、脫褲子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-20","sourceFront":"脫","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你的白襯衫上面有一個黑點，快脫下來，我幫你洗一洗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-06","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L13-1-04\",\"差別\",\"差別\",\"差别\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請你說明一下，這些產品的功能有什麼差別？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-06","sourceFront":"功能","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這兩臺機器樣子相同，但在構造與功能上是有差別的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-14","sourceFront":"構造","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當室內與戶外溫度的差別很大時，我就容易感冒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-09","sourceFront":"室內","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-07\",\"攤販\",\"攤販\",\"摊贩\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"何小姐習慣去傳統市場買水果，而且都跟同一個攤販買。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-07","sourceFront":"攤販","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Combining 攤(spread out) and 販(merchant): 攤販 means street vendors."},{"key":"[\"B3L05-2-22\",\"救災\",\"救災\",\"救灾\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那場強烈地震發生以後，許多國家的專業人員都來救災，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-22","sourceFront":"救災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"救災工作不容易，一個人的力量是不夠的，得大家一起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-26","sourceFront":"力量","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"當軍隊一到達災區，就聽到了求救的聲音，所以立刻開始救災工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-25","sourceFront":"災區","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"地震後救災人員把握分分秒秒，努力把被困在房子底下的民眾救出來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-29","sourceFront":"分分秒秒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"發生大地震後，民眾都發揮愛心，主動提供救災的相關用品給災民。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-09","sourceFront":"相關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"地震救災人員聽到東邊大約五公尺以外的地方，有人發出求救的聲音，就立刻趕過去救人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-19","sourceFront":"發出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"強烈颱風快來了，救災中心對民眾發出警告，為了自己的生命安全，絕對別去海邊","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-20","sourceFront":"警告","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場大地震發生後不久，軍人就立刻趕到了災區，協助救災工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-26","sourceFront":"協助","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到地震災區救災的軍人們，這幾天忙得連一頓飯都沒辦法好好地吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-04","sourceFront":"頓","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 救(aid) and 災(disaster): 救災 means provide disaster relief."},{"key":"[\"B3L06-2-28\",\"过去\",\"過去\",\"过去\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他參加了服務社團的活動後，生活比過去更豐富、更有意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-28","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小王手裡提著那麼多東西，好像很重，我們過去幫他提一些吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-01","sourceFront":"提","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"便利商店不遠，從我家過去只要五分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-44","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"地震救災人員聽到東邊大約五公尺以外的地方，有人發出求救的聲音，就立刻趕過去救人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-19","sourceFront":"發出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人的一生都應該好好規劃，日子才不會白白地過去","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-11","sourceFront":"白白","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那輛腳踏車對個子小的我來說太高了，腳很難跨過去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-27","sourceFront":"跨","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果說能回到過去，我最想放下工作，追求自己的興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-33","sourceFront":"如果說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些事忍耐一下就過去了，什麼都想以吵架的方式解決，遲早會出事的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-14","sourceFront":"出事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人生短短幾十年，一輩子很快就過去了，因此應該活得精彩、過得有意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-12","sourceFront":"人生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從過去到現在，尊敬長輩一直是華人最重視的傳統觀念之一。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-39","sourceFront":"傳統","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛拖了地，地上還是溼的，你最好繞過去比較安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-43","sourceFront":"繞","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L09-1-03\",\"醒\",\"醒\",\"醒\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"弟弟做了一個可怕的夢，夜裡三點就醒了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-03","sourceFront":"醒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"台灣的夏天熱極了，要是房間沒有冷氣，半夜可能會被熱醒，甚至整個晚上睡不著。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-03","sourceFront":"醒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我每天早上一醒來就去刷牙、洗臉，然後去附近國小的操場跑步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-19","sourceFront":"醒來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛剛忘了把垃圾拿出去丟，還好你提醒我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-11","sourceFront":"提醒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"醫生提醒我少吃油、鹽和糖，以減輕身體的負擔。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-03","sourceFront":"減輕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"練習八百公尺跑步時，教練除了要大家記得自己是跑第幾棒的，並且提醒我們把棒子拿好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-26","sourceFront":"棒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的頭部被棒球打中並當場昏迷，還好幾分鐘後就醒過來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-06","sourceFront":"昏迷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"帶孩子到餐廳用餐，得提醒他們別到處奔跑，免得跌倒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-11","sourceFront":"奔跑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我習慣把每一筆支出都記錄起來，提醒自己少花點兒錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-17","sourceFront":"支出","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師提醒學生有疑問要馬上解決，免得越到後面越不了解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-16","sourceFront":"疑問","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Sleeping off heavy jars of fermented 酉(wine) until dawn morning 星(star) shines helps the drinker 醒(wake up)."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-05\",\"当作\",\"當作/當做\",\"当作/当做\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小安有一張娃娃臉，到哪裡都被當作大學生，誰知道他已經四十歲了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-05","sourceFront":"當作","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在歐洲，小麥做的各種食品常被當作餐桌上的主要食物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-41","sourceFront":"小麥","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她做的籃子很漂亮，很多人買來當作禮物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-12","sourceFront":"籃子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的夢想是利用水來當作交通工具的燃料，可是很多人認為不可能。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-53","sourceFront":"燃料","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果從事某項工作能令你忘掉時間，或許就可當作一生的事業。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-26","sourceFront":"從事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家中式點心店的紅豆沙包子又香又甜，我時常買來當作早餐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-28","sourceFront":"沙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"露營時我沒帶枕頭，只好把背包當作枕頭，睡起來挺不舒服的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-08","sourceFront":"枕頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我逛街時經過了一排小吃攤，就買幾樣回來當作宵夜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-39","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王媽媽一直把媳婦當作自己的女兒，當他們家的媳婦真幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-09","sourceFront":"媳婦","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那只鑽石戒指的設計極有特色，很適合當作婚戒(wedding ring)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-38","sourceFront":"戒指","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小周找到理想工作後，女友特地送了一條領帶當作禮物，還親手為他打領帶，祝賀他有個好的開始。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-07","sourceFront":"領帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他想寫一本以各行各業人物當作題材的長篇小說。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-01","sourceFront":"各行各業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"紀念郵票一般都是以歷史上的大事或重要人物當作主題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-42","sourceFront":"郵票","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想導演一部以蟲子當作主角的電影，真不是件容易的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-05","sourceFront":"導演","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在戶外的夜景中攝影，以月光當作背景可增加神秘的感覺。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-24","sourceFront":"月光","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-08\",\"罐子\",\"罐子\",\"罐子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"食品罐頭吃完以後把罐子洗乾淨，就可以回收了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-09","sourceFront":"罐頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"媽媽把放在院子裡的一堆空瓶子、空罐子都扔了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-12","sourceFront":"空","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請你把空罐子放在袋子裡，好讓垃圾車一起回收。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-24","sourceFront":"好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-2-19\",\"挤\",\"擠\",\"挤\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"電腦展內的人太多了，大家擠來擠去的，真是受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-19","sourceFront":"擠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"教授的房間堆滿了各種書籍，本來就不大的房間感覺更擠了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-25","sourceFront":"堆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"上下班的時候，捷運站有很多人，總是很擠。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-05","sourceFront":"擠","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這處風景區非常有名，假日都擠滿了遊客。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-39","sourceFront":"處","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天搭捷運參加演唱會的民眾很多，車上擠得都不能轉身。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-30","sourceFront":"轉身","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-2-20\",\"癌症\",\"癌症\",\"癌症\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"隨著空氣被汙染的情況越來越嚴重，得到癌症的機會也增加了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-20","sourceFront":"癌症","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-21\",\"錄用\",\"錄用\",\"录用\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"企業為了錄用合適的人才，而採用各式各樣的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-21","sourceFront":"錄用","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-04\",\"初级\",\"初級\",\"初级\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他很聰明，成績又非常好，因此完成初級班的課程後，學校讓他跳過中級，到高級班學習，一連跳了兩級。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-04","sourceFront":"初級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"可能\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"可(can) + 能(can) → 'can can': it's possible → 可能 means maybe."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"想要\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"想(to want) + 要(to want) → 想要 means to want to."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"意思\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"意(meaning) + 思(think) → the meaning you think of. 意思 means 'meaning'."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"承認\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 承(char) and 認(know): 承認 means admit."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"拜\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 龵(hand) holds 一(one) 丰(abundant) stalk and bends low to 拜(bow)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"禮拜\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"禮拜 means week. It comes from 禮(ceremony)+拜(worship), the weekly worship day."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"良好\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 良(good) and 好(good): 良好 means good, well."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"菜\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 艹(grass) 采(collect) basket rests on the table → one green 菜(dish)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"行為\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 行(walk) and 為(do): 行為 means behavior, conduct."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"補\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 衤(cloth) that 甫(to begin) to tear needs a needle and thread to make it whole again: 補(fix)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"請教\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 請(ask) a 教(education): 請教 means ask."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"關\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 門(door) woven of 𢆶(silk threads) and 丱(twin posts) stands shut → the gate will 關(close)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"雜\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 亠(lid) covers 从(follow) as a 木(tree) and 隹(bird) crowd together → a 雜(mix)."}]}
